  "The Beaufort scale groups wind speeds by their effect, from calm at force 0 to hurricane force at 12, so a single number gives a sense of how the wind will feel and what it can move.": "蒲福风级按风的效应对风速分级，从 0 级静风到 12 级飓风，一个数字就能说明风吹在身上的感觉及其能吹动什么。",
  "The Moon’s path around Earth isn’t a circle, so it drifts nearer and farther over the weeks. The figure here runs from the center of Earth to the center of the Moon at the moment shown, roughly 356,000 to 407,000 km (221,000 to 253,000 mi).": "月球绕地球的轨道不是正圆，因此几周内它会时远时近。这里的数值是所示时刻地心到月心的距离，大约在 356,000 至 407,000 km（221,000 至 253,000 mi）之间。",
  "The UV index measures the strength of the sun’s ultraviolet radiation. The higher it is, the faster unprotected skin can burn. At 3 (moderate) and above, the World Health Organization advises shade, sunscreen, a hat and covering clothing.": "紫外线指数衡量太阳紫外线辐射的强度。数值越高，未加防护的皮肤越快被晒伤。达到 3（中等）及以上时，世界卫生组织建议使用遮荫、防晒霜、帽子和遮盖身体的衣物。",
  "The actual temperature.": "实际温度。",
  "The air is clean, and nothing in it should bother anyone.": "空气清洁，不会对任何人造成困扰。",
  "The average high is the mean high temperature for {date}, taken over a week either side, in every year since {since}. Monthly averages are the mean daily lows and highs of each month in those years.": "平均最高温度是自 {since} 以来所有年份中，{date}前后各一周的最高温度的平均值。每月平均值是这些年份中各月日最低和日最高温度的平均值。",
  "The average humidity today is higher than yesterday.": "今天的平均湿度高于昨天。",
  "The average humidity today is lower than yesterday.": "今天的平均湿度低于昨天。",
  "The average humidity today is similar to yesterday.": "今天的平均湿度与昨天相近。",
  "The dew point is the temperature the air would need to cool to for dew to form. It tells you how humid the air feels better than relative humidity does: the higher it is, the muggier it feels.": "露点是空气冷却到开始凝结成露所需的温度。它比相对湿度更能反映空气的潮湿闷热程度：露点越高，越觉得闷热。",
  "The dew point is {dew} right now.": "当前露点为 {dew}。",
