  "The dew point will be {low}° to {high}°.": "露点将为 {low}° 至 {high}°。",
  "The finest dust and soot in the air, small enough to get through the lungs into the blood. Most of it is smoke, from fires, engines and chimneys.": "空气中最细的粉尘和烟尘，小到能穿过肺部进入血液。大部分是来自火灾、发动机和烟囱的烟雾。",
  "The forecast has no hourly temperatures for this day.": "该日的预报没有逐小时温度。",
  "The forecast has no hourly values for this day.": "该日的预报没有逐小时数值。",
  "The high temperature today is higher than yesterday.": "今天的最高温度高于昨天。",
  "The high temperature today is lower than yesterday.": "今天的最高温度低于昨天。",
  "The high temperature today is similar to yesterday.": "今天的最高温度与昨天相近。",
  "The normal range shows the most common temperatures for {date} since {since}, about 80% of them: at each hour, from the lowest tenth of that hour’s temperatures, a week either side of the date, to the highest tenth. Where today’s line is below the range, it is among the coldest tenth for its time of day; where it is above, among the warmest.": "正常范围显示自 {since} 以来 {date} 最常见的温度，约占 80%：在每个小时，从该日前后各一周内该小时温度中最低的十分之一，到最高的十分之一。今天的曲线低于该范围时，属于同一时段最冷的十分之一；高于该范围时，属于最暖的十分之一。",
  "The peak UV index today is higher than yesterday.": "今天的紫外线指数峰值高于昨天。",
