  "Thick fog is affecting visibility.": "浓雾影响能见度。",
  "This air is starting to matter for anyone with heart or lung disease, and for older adults and children. Most other people should be fine.": "这种空气已开始对心脏或肺部疾病患者、老年人和儿童产生影响。其他大多数人应该没有问题。",
  "This is the share of the Moon’s visible face in sunlight at the moment shown, worked out from where it is in its monthly cycle: 0% at new moon and 100% at full. The card doesn’t look at the sky, so the figure is the same whether the Moon is up or set, and whatever the clouds are doing.": "这是所示时刻月球可见面被阳光照亮的比例，根据它在每月周期中的位置计算：新月时为 0%，满月时为 100%。卡片并不观测天空，因此无论月亮在地平线上还是已落下，也无论云况如何，数值都相同。",
  "This is the top of the scale. The air is dangerous for everyone, and the safest place is indoors with the windows shut.": "这是量表的最高级别。空气对所有人都有危险，最安全的地方是门窗紧闭的室内。",
